/*===========================================================================*/
/*  TurBoNC view style — NEON (default)                                      */
/*                                                                           */
/*  The neon look (translucent gradient panels, 1px neon borders, beveled    */
/*  edges, glow) is the base theme itself, so this overlay intentionally     */
/*  contains no rules. The active base theme (dark/light x accent) provides  */
/*  the whole look.                                                          */
/*                                                                           */
/*  Overlays may use accent placeholder tokens (see view_styles.py) should   */
/*  you want to add refinements on top of the base theme.                    */
/*===========================================================================*/
